    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "一句话理解",
      "items": [
        "一条命令在本机拉起 4 个进程：Agent Server、Automation、静态前端、Ingress",
        "浏览器只认 :8000，由 Ingress 按路径分发"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Ingress 路由",
      "items": [
        "/api/automation → :18001",
        "/api、/sockets、/server_info … → :18000",
        "/vscode → 编辑器；其余 → 静态前端 :3001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "安全细节",
      "items": [
        "Session API Key 保存在 ~/.openhands/agent-canvas/api-key.txt",
        "静态服务把 Key 注入页面，前端请求带 X-Session-API-Key"
      ]
    }
